# Examples are not verifiable in the agent browser

Cursor’s IDE browser does **not** have [Inference Bridge](https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/inference-bridge/ekjldffogogadhfhgkibgkfdhhikfamd). `window.inference` is never injected there, so IPA demos under `examples/` cannot be exercised end to end.

Do not:

- Retry chat, translate, avatar, social, nostr, charts, speech, or similar demo flows in that browser
- Stub or inject a fake `window.inference` to work around the missing bridge
- Treat the connect-extension / unavailable banner as a failed check of the ready path

Verify by reading the code or asking the user to try it with Inference Bridge installed. The only UI the agent browser can show is the unavailable empty state.
